WEBVTT

00:01:26.360 --> 00:01:30.216
AHP: I think the condition of burnout
is the millennial condition.

00:01:30.240 --> 00:01:35.129
So it's the thing that best describes
this generation's baseline.

00:01:35.153 --> 00:01:36.686
(Music)

00:01:36.710 --> 00:01:39.246
AG: I agree that burnout is a big problem.

00:01:39.270 --> 00:01:41.281
I'd just make a little edit.

00:01:41.910 --> 00:01:45.606
Burnout can happen to anyone,
in any line of work,

00:01:45.630 --> 00:01:47.313
but it doesn't have to.

00:01:47.778 --> 00:01:54.376
(Music)

00:01:54.400 --> 00:01:57.941
I'm Adam Grant, and this is WorkLife,
my podcast with TED.

00:01:57.965 --> 00:01:59.946
I'm an organizational psychologist.

00:01:59.970 --> 00:02:03.206
I study how to make work not suck.